  "description": "The only way out is through.\n\nIn the midst of a disastrous monster attack fated to end the world, a strange device throws Hee-Jae back in time 20 years where he meets the students of his foster father, Seok-Young. Now it's up to him to take them under his wing and stop the apocalypse so he can finally set off for a peaceful life.\n\n(Source: Manta)",
